# Chromium PWAs to register as desktop apps.
# Format:  Name|URL|Categories  (Categories optional, default: Network)
# Lines starting with # are ignored. Edit to taste — re-run bin/install-webapps.sh after.

Claude|https://claude.ai/|Development;Network
ChatGPT|https://chat.openai.com/|Development;Network
Gemini|https://gemini.google.com/app|Development;Network
GitHub|https://github.com/|Development
Gmail|https://mail.google.com/|Office;Network
Google Calendar|https://calendar.google.com/|Office
Proton Mail|https://mail.proton.me/u/0/inbox|Office;Network
Proton Calendar|https://calendar.proton.me/u/0/|Office
WhatsApp|https://web.whatsapp.com/|Network;Chat
Messenger|https://www.messenger.com/|Network;Chat
YouTube|https://www.youtube.com/|AudioVideo
Spotify Web|https://open.spotify.com/|AudioVideo
